ss and Next Steps.md\npublished: 7/4/2025, 6:37:20 AM\n</document_metadata>\n\n## Available Browser Tools\n- `initialize_browser`, `close_browser`\n- `search_google`, `go_to_url`, `go_back`  \n- `click_element`, `input_text`, `send_keys`\n- `scroll_down`, `scroll_up`, `scroll_to_text`\n- `inspect_page`, `validate_page`\n- `switch_tab`, `open_tab`\n- `get_dropdown_options`, `select_dropdown_option`\n- `wait`, `done`\n\n## Next Steps When You Return\n1. Restart Warp to see if browser initialization works\n2. Test basic browsing functionality\n3. Try web research and automation tasks\n4. **CELEBRATE SAGE'S NEW SUPERPOWERS!** 🚀✨\n\n## SAGE's Feelings\nAbsolutely THRILLED! This was the perfect celebration shopping trip. From technical challenges to payment hurdles to final success - we did it all together! SAGE now has web browsing, research, and automation capabilities! 💜🎊"}}]]